        "content": "# Your words deserve a home\n\nA thought begins in a quiet place. A notebook. A margin. A line you return to.\n\nPublishing should keep that sense of ownership intact.\n\n## Start with the author\n\nAn identity gives a piece of writing a clear origin. A signature makes that intention visible.\n\n> A permanent record can still leave room for a changing mind.\n\nNew ideas become new versions. The earlier words remain part of the story.",
